{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["In 5th century AD, a child hostage exchange was arranged, to keep peace between the Huns and the Romans. Attila, future king of the Huns was sent to the Roman court in exchange for which Roman hostage?","Flavius Aetius"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"history\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
