{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["The Marshall Plan of 1947 offered massive economic aid to help war-devastated nations in Europe. However, communist controlled Eastern Europe received none of the aid for what reason?","The Soviet dictator Stalin refused to allow any communist controlled nation of Eastern Europe to receive Marshall Plan aid"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"history\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
